window.products.push({"id":1061233,"name":"21st Birthday Decorations Kit, Rose Gold Happy Birthday Balloon Banner and Big Number 21 Balloon, Black Birthday Sash, 21 Year Old Party Supplies for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7149CwyOB-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Great value set - rose gold 21st birthday party supplies - Tired of picking out pretty and chic party decorations after a long time searching on Amazon? Maybe this all-in-one decorations pack could help you. FEATURES: ★ \"HAPPY BIRTHDAY” Balloon Letters Banner-- Shining rose gold HAPPY BIRTHDAY balloon banner are so bright, so beautiful and bling-bing on your party. This set will make a fun backdrop or photo prop for this milestone birthday! ★ Number Balloon 21-- Rose Gold balloons Number 2 and 1 are perfect focal décor on your gift table or even on your buffet area. ★ Finally 21 Satin Sash-- This finally legal sash is made of black satin fabric, super pretty with gold font. ★ Confetti / Latex Balloons-- Made of clear latex with good quality, reusable and the confetti inside the balloon is clear to be watched. ★ Sparkly Paper Pennant Banner-- The glitter garlands are made of high quality Glitter Premium Paper; cute and reusable.  ★ Heart Foil Balloons/ Mini Champagne Cheers Balloons-- Made of high quality aluminum foil balloons and auto-seal. PACKAGE INCLUDE: √ 1x Happy Birthday Banner, Inflatable: air, Non Floating √ 1x Number 21 Balloons, Inflatable: Helium or air √ 1x 21th Birthday Sash  √ 1x Rose Gold Triangle Flag  √ 5x Confetti Balloons/ 10x Latex Balloons, Inflatable: Helium or air √ 2x Heart Foil Balloons, Inflatable: Helium or air √ 1x Wine Glass Balloons, Inflatable: air √ 1x 32 ft Gold String; NOTE: √ 1. Mylar balloons have Self-sealing valve for easy inflation and deflation. √ 2. Inflate slowly with air or helium; just fill 90% of the balloons' space that could allow the balloon to expand completely. √ 3. Please be gentle and careful when inflate the balloons, don’t be too fast especially using a pump.  √ 4. Do not put the decorations close to the fire.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7149CwyOB-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alodidae","source_asin":"B07DN7QGRP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1061233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DN7QGRP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DN7QGRP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1061234,"name":"Farberware Professional Hand Crank Manual Juicer, White/Orange","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FwfPggzIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Farberware professional manual juice press is prefect for those who live an active and healthy lifestyle. This sturdy, single auger juice press is perfect for making juice out of a wide variety of fruits, vegetables and even wheat grass. It is easy to use. Simply attached the juicer to the counter using the strong, suctioned base. Add your fruits and vegetables into the juicer then turn the easy-to-use hand crank. Instantly turning your fruits and vegetables into a tasty and healthy beverage! this juicer creates a smooth, enjoyable Texture. With the manual design, you don't have to worry about having electricity -you can juice anywhere. Perfect for rv'ing, and camping. All removable parts are dishwasher safe, wipe down the juicer with a damp cloth as needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FwfPggzIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Farberware","source_asin":"B072DX1W9W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1061234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072DX1W9W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072DX1W9W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1061235,"name":"Commercial Bakeware Mini Muffin Pan, 24-Cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.63,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iaHEMNSJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Focus Foodservice commercial bakeware pans are manufactured to meet theh exacting standards of the toughest commercial bakeries and foodservice establishments. Each pan is crafted from heavy-guage alumninized steel, a 3 ply material consisting of two layers of tough corrosion resistant 3003 aluminum alloy around the durability, strength, and superior heat conduction of carbon steel. The frame is constructed with a heavy reinforcing rod to keep the pan from warping during baking. These Focus bakeware muffin pans are offered with a silicone coating that provides easy release of baked products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iaHEMNSJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FOCUS FOODSERVICE","source_asin":"B07QNZJDTY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1061235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QNZJDTY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QNZJDTY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1061236,"name":"Calphalon Katana Stainless-Steel 6-Inch Utility Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/215VWYXMNGL._AC_.jpg","description":"Named for the sacred sword carried by Japan's Samurai warriors, Calphalon Katana Series cutlery has its roots in a centuries-old tradition of superior cutlery craftsmanship. Like the awe-inspiring swords wielded by the Samurai, Calphalon Katana Series cutlery is crafted using a time-honored layering process that creates a Damascus style blade, clad with 33 stainless steel layers. This unique series of cutlery uses VG Japanese steel, which provides exceptional sharpness and ultimate edge retention. These knives also feature a patented integrated bolster design and an ergonomically designed poly-resign handle. The Utility knife is the perfect in-between size for dozens of day-to-day tasks. The silhouette is similar to the paring knife but is longer in length making it useful for light cutting, slicing and peeling chores.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/215VWYXMNGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calphalon","source_asin":"B000AAT6NW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1061236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000AAT6NW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000AAT6NW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
