window.products.push({"id":1061266,"name":"EXA Set of 6 Seagrass Hanging Wall Basket Decor Orange Blossom Decorative Boho Rustic Wall Art - Flat Round Rattan Wall Decor Handmade Wicker Woven Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":50.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pp6ez3wtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ A NICE TOUCH TO SPACE: EXA woven basket wall decor is a precious gift from skilled Vietnamese artisans that makes your monotonous walls very attractive and decorative, adding homey warmth to any space! These delicate decorative plates for wall hanging may provide an organic, natural, and rustic touch to your home. It's never been easier to give your space an instant refresh! ✅ ENCHANTING BOHO STYLE: Our woven wall decor baskets are crafted from natural seagrass which has the elements of the natural reed, including some light green, beige and brown tones. These earthy colors tend to be easy and super stylish to decorate with. This 6-piece collection of decorative trays is a terrific way to add some breezy bohemian charm to your house and bring your living space an organic, natural, and rustic accent. ✅ ENDLESS POSSIBILITIES: EXA Boho woven wall basket is much more than a decorative piece! With zero chemical smell and various sizes, our products are perfectly fit for your kitchen, living room, and bedroom. The woven trays can be used to store food and various small things or can be used as placemats for hot pans or to serve bowls for candy and snacks. ✅ 100% NATURAL MATERIALS: Our round wall hanging baskets are created entirely of 100% seagrass - the natural material which is both sustainable and biodegradable. Seagrass is one of the long-standing traditional industries in Vietnam. It is widely used in interior decoration and well-recognized for its beauty, durability, flexible construction, and high applicability to make various handicraft seagrass basket products, especially woven wall baskets. ✅ EASY TO HANG AND KEEP CLEAN: Our seagrass wicker baskets arrive all ready to hang. There is a hook on the back of the products, so you can hang it on the wall conveniently. You can easily keep the wall baskets clean by gently wiping them with a damp cloth and then dry in a cool place with gentle sunlight. ✅ GREAT GIFT IDEA: This set of 6 wall hanging baskets can also be a perfect gift for your mother, friends, or beloved ones, who appreciates ethically made homeware and art. Our handcrafted baskets will be a one-of-a-kind present that everyone will appreciate. We send in a high-quality package that is ready to impress your friends and family. ✅ 100% LIFETIME WARRANTY: For any reason you're not completely satisfied, you are free to get in touch with us and you can ask for a replacement or full refund, no questions asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pp6ez3wtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EXA","source_asin":"B0BDX91MZ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1061266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDX91MZ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDX91MZ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
