window.products.push({"id":1061272,"name":"PUMERIT Vintage Big Wall Clock Rustic Retro Metal Wall Décor 24 Inch Handmade Not-Ticking for Living Room Hotel Restaurant Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71afBgfLVyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"PUMERIT vintage metal wall clock is a very sturdy and well built beautiful work of art. With the classic roman numerals design in black embellishing with rust colors, and decorative golden hands, this retro metal wall clock adds plush vintage personality to any room in your home, office, bar, shop, restaurant, hotel and so on. Specification: Size: 24inch dia. Net. Weight: Materials: Iron, sun brand silent quartz movement, metal clock hands. Style: Vintage style Notice for Use: 1. Carbon Zinc Battery Required: The metal wall clock required 1 AA battery (not included) to work. In order to make sure the clock to work in a longer span, stable and accurate, we suggest use carbon zinc battery instead of alkaline battery. 2. Please adjust the rustic clock time with the red button on the back of clock, and do not fiddle the clock hands directly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71afBgfLVyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PUMERIT","source_asin":"B07J57T7HC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1061272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J57T7HC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J57T7HC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1061273,"name":"Oil Sprayer for Cooking | 220ML Glass Olive Oil Sprayer Mister | Kitchen Gadgets Accessories | Continuous Spray with Control - Save Oil | Widely Used ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JvVYGzI2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The oil mister bottle that holds the oil is made of premium glass and has a very nice large opening for ease of filling it with the oil that you need. The top section with the nozzle is sturdy plastic works very well. It responds quickly, and very little pressure is needed on the trigger to make it work. [👏GREAT KITCHEN GADGETS - SPRAY EVENLY👏] The glass oil mister works great and spreads spray evenly, no finger fatigue with this style pump. The nozzle has an awesome spray feature, a nice wide spray but not a mist or a stream. Perfect enough that it doesn't get clogged and doesn't require many sprays to coat the entire pan. The olive oil sprayer is a great alternative to buying canned olive oil spray, easy to use and refill, sprays evenly. [⭐️PUMP SPRAYER WITH SELF-STICK LABELS⭐️] The oil sprayer for air fryer not only works great evenly spreading olive oil, but also misting avocado, canola, vegetable, coconut, grapeseed oil, balsamic vinegar and salad dressing and more liquid water and oil. Comes with nice stickers so you can label the bottle with the type of oils and vinegars you put in it. No clogs or spills, dispenses the oil as a mist that covers everything well. [❤️HANDY KITCHEN GIFT FOR FAMILY CHEF❤️] Perfect 220ml size and capacity, easy to refill and use, allows to fill it completely and always gives a nice even spray with a simple pull of the trigger. Easy to clean especially with the large size opening in the bottle. Sprays perfectly with no worries or clumps of product getting into the small tube. Portable gift for chef in your family. [💕GOOD FOR SALAD & PAN & OVEN & GRILL💕] The mister spray bottle would quickly become one of the most used gadgets in your kitchen, work perfectly to lightly spray oil either on a pan, or stir fry, or in an air fryer. Futhermore, the olive oil spray for laying down a fine layer of oil atop foods you are cooking in a roaster, pan, oven and grill. Quick easy way to coat food, such as fish, chicken, vegetables, potatoes etc. [👍OIL DISPENSER - GODSEND FOR AIR FRYER👍] If you wanting something that lightly coated food for your air fryer and waffle iron plates, our oil sprayer for cooking is a big help. Just enough of a coating to get things crispy without worry of over dousing and making everything soggy and oily, gives the food a little kiss of oil that crisps up and its just wonderful. Also, the sprayers dispenser the oil evenly and in good amounts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JvVYGzI2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MsPrLs","source_asin":"B0C2L6MHPL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1061273","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2L6MHPL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2L6MHPL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
