window.products.push({"id":1061349,"name":"Wine Opener，Cooko Rabbit Style Corkscrew Wine Bottle Opener，professional Wine Opener Kit,waiter Corkscrew with Foil Cutter in Luxurious Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Q0ySZKvNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"1.Open Any Bottle With Ease,The COOKO Automatic Lever Opener makes opening any bottle of wine a breeze. After placing the corkscrew on top of the cork, a simple pull of the lever downwards and upwards will ensure the cork flawlessly leaves the bottle and won't be damaged in the process. This allows you to kick back and enjoy your wine, without having to worry about pieces of cork floating around.  2.Efficient Use And Durable Through Innovative And Compact Design,Unlike with some other standard corkscrews, the COOKO requires very little force to open the bottle and at the same time is more durable than the majority electric corkscrews. The compact design is easy to use and also allows for easy storage in your cabinet, without taking up valuable space on your kitchen counter or on your bar.  3.Includes Bonus Foil Cutter And Extra Spiral Worm,The bonus handheld foil cutter effortlessly prepares wine bottles for serving. The 4-wheel system with razor-sharp blades quickly removes foil and the one-step operation requires no more than a quarter turn of the wrist. The spare spiral worm ensures that you'll always have the COOKO available, even when you're washing the other.  4.Fantastic Gift Idea With Its Sleek Packaging,The 3-Piece COOKO Wine Opener is presented in a sleek buckle box that makes it ideal for gift giving. Whether it is for a birthday, wedding, anniversary, Christmas, or any other occasion; all wine lovers and those new to wine are bound to appreciate this gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Q0ySZKvNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cooko","source_asin":"B018U6JMKO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1061349","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018U6JMKO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018U6JMKO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
