window.products.push({"id":1061478,"name":"Reusable Tea Infuser Ball for Loose Leaf Tea, Unique Flower Shape, Fine Mesh Stainless Steel Single Serve Strainer and Steeper with Charming Drip Tray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21erljW63CL._AC_.jpg","description":"MAKE YOUR \"ME TIME\" EXTRA SPECIAL: Add beauty and flavor to your tea routine with this unique and practical tea diffuser. Boasting a cute, flower-shaped design and a delicate chain link with a sturdy hook, plus a stylish, matching drip tray our tea infuser for loose tea is one-of-a-kind, combining convenience with charm to improve your tea drinking experience. Whether at the dinner table, the bathtub, or on the patio, enjoy an elevated drinking experience with the Lily & Bee tea accessories set FULL FLAVORED AND NUTRITIOUS TEA: Ensure every cup of tea is infused and flavored to perfection with the Lily & Bee tea strainer ball. Comprised of ultra-fine, 0.1mm mesh - our tea infuser ball for loose leaf tea easily contains high quality medium to large leaf teas allowing water flow and leaf steeping and expansion so your favorite tea can unleash its nutrients, flavor and aroma. Enjoy enriched, full-bodied tea the way it was meant to be tasted. CONVENIENT DESIGN: We want your cup of tea to be delicious and relaxing with no unwanted fuss. Our single-serve tea infusers were engineered for seamless and top-notch functionality. Featuring a 4 inch chain which hooks around the cup's brim or handle, a simple hinge and clasp system to make maneuverability a breeze, tight seals to minimize leaf leakage, and a stylish drip tray to catch mess, steeping can be done sans hands or mess and you can focus on relaxing and drinking your flavorsome tea. CRAFTED FROM HIGH QUALITY FOOD-GRADE 18/8 STAINLESS STEEL: We want to provide a long-lasting sustainable and economical loose leaf tea infuser so that you can prevent waste and save money with every cup of tea. Non-toxic, BPA-free, and dye-free, our tea holder ball is safe for you and your family, while still providing outstanding performance cup after cup. The ultra-fine mesh infuser is easy to clean by rinsing and air-drying, ready for making tasty hot, sweet or iced tea time and time again. THE PERFECT TEA GIFT SET: Each tea steeper and drip tray is furnished in a beautiful gift box that makes this tea kit a great gift for all tea lovers. Ideal for women, moms, grandparents, or tea drinkers in general, the Lily & Bee tea filter ball makes a beautiful present for Mother's Day, Father's Day, Valentine's Day, Christmas, birthdays, baby showers, anniversaries, graduations, Thank-yous, farewells, or housewarming parties. Or a special treat just for you, because you deserve it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21erljW63CL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lily & Bee","source_asin":"B07HRFJCQ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1061478","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HRFJCQ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HRFJCQ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1061479,"name":"Merryfeel 100% Linen Extra Pillow Covers - Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VY5xbwEpL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"A set of 2 pillow covers in 100% linen woven from European flax, pre-washed for softness. Merryfeel is brand focused on the intersection of modern design, affordability and community. Everything we sell—from tablelinen to bedding and bathrobe—is made with one goal in mind: to help our customers express their personal style at home and in the world.We're international with our online shop spreads our footprint even wider, shipping Merryfeel product anywhere in the US,UK, Europe ,Fareast and to over 90 countries worldwide. Basically, we're everywhere you are. We care about impact too. By designing over 90% of our products in–house, our design team has steadily increased our selection of organic, handcrafted, sustainably sourced from all over the world products. There's a story behind everything we sell—one that starts in Merryfeel and lives on with you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VY5xbwEpL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Merryfeel","source_asin":"B0753DDPDG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1061479","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0753DDPDG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0753DDPDG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1061480,"name":"Sausage Roll Maker by StarBlue with FREE Recipe ebook – Make 4 Quick and Delicious Breakfast Sausage Rolls and Snacks in Minutes AC120V 60Hz 850W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817w+KT7V6S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️ VERSATILE APPLICATIONS - The food-grade and smartly designed breakfast machine have the capacity to make 4 sausage rolls simultaneously that enables you to make more of them in less time. The versatile snack maker is perfect for making various types of rolls, pies, desserts, hot dog bread, and various other breakfast and snack items. ✔️ SAFE AND FUNCTIONAL - This electric skillet has a non-stick coating that makes it more functional and reliable, while the heat-insulated handle allows you to open and use the hot sausage roll maker easily. The durable electric pie maker is equipped with advanced thermal cutout and thermo fuse technology that keeps it safe in case of voltage fluctuation, short circuit, and other such problems. ✔️ SLEEK AND COMPACT - The breakfast sausage casing is not only highly convenient to use but also has a simple but elegant style with a white, smoothly finished outlook. This lightweight and compact food maker takes less storage space and can be stored in an upright position. Put it on your kitchen slab, cabinet, kitchen table, or wherever you want and add a classy touch. ✔️ EASY TO USE AND CLEAN - With its automatic and safe functions, this hot dog machine is so easy to use that can make breakfast by yourself. The non-stick cooling plates of the electric grill machine making it more convenient to clean the mini griddle with a wet sponge. ✔️ IDEAL GIFT - This highly functional breakfast maker is a perfect gift choice for every busy bachelor, working woman, student, parents, etc. Add a little more convenience to their life with this convenient and quick breakfast maker and help them save a lot of time. The breakfast griddle makes a suitable gift for any special occasion like birthday, anniversary, house warming, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817w+KT7V6S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"StarBlue","source_asin":"B08D2Z11BV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1061480","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D2Z11BV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D2Z11BV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
