window.products.push({"id":1061545,"name":"Holiday Jingle Christmas Ornament Gold Bell - Holiday Jingle Bell Ornament Christmas Bell Ornament 2022–Real Bell Christmas Decoration with Red Ribbon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ayq02nXxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At Holiday Jingles, we believe in the magic of Christmas. For one day a year, everyone gets together, celebrating love and having a retrospect of the year that has just gone by. To help you remember the most important achievements and events of the past year, we have designed a superb 2022 ornament collection that will look absolutely stunning in your tree. Don’t worry: if for whatever reason you are not entirely happy with the order, our customer support team is always at your disposal. Enter Into the Holiday Spirit On the Sound of Our Jingle Bells!This gorgeous 2022 Christmas bell is a must-have for your holiday décor and Christmas tree, given its beautiful aesthetics and delicate sound. Elegant and refined, our bell Christmas decoration is a great way to celebrate the best things of 2022 and share them with family and friends. This collectible Xmas ornament comes with a lovely red ribbon bow and is engraved with “Christmas 2022” standing as the ending mark for a beautiful year. To make things more special, our gold ornament is a real bell that makes a calming sound that will boost your mood and fill your heart with joy! Some of the amazing features of this product: Classy bell ornament for the Christmas tree; Color: Gold; Bell design; Durable and reliable; Premium craftmanship; Laser-engraved; Red ribbon included; Comes with a colored gift box; Size: 3 x 2.5-inch; The bell emits a pleasant holiday ring; Lovely present for family and friends. Make the most of your Christmas holiday with our 2022 bell ornament!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ayq02nXxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Jingle","source_asin":"B0BBSGCLJ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1061545","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBSGCLJ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBSGCLJ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
