window.products.push({"id":1061574,"name":"Hand Sanitizer Dispenser, Automatic Touchless Soap Dispenser, Infrared Sensor 600ml Gel/Liquid Soap Dispenser Wall Mount Operated for Hospital,Airport","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WSkQTHK1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Automatic Soap Dispenser】 Wall mounted hand dispenser can highly improve hand hygiene and keep hands without touching anything.Our touchless sanitizer dispenser can release suitable soap when the sensor detects your hands. 【More Environmentally】This soap dispenser has a capacity of 600ml, and its compact size is suitable for homes and public places. The completely transparent design allows you to replenish the liquid in time and can be reused. It will produce 1ml per induction, and it can be used about 600 times after one replenishment, so there is no worry that the solution inside will deteriorate after being left for too long. 【Non-Drip Design】 This soap dispenser uses smart sensors and will not drip, leak or overflow. This hands-free soap dispenser is made of durable ABS plastic material and upgraded chip, with long-lasting strength and use effect. 【Wide Application】Our soap dispensers wall mounted are suitable for bathrooms, kitchens, restaurants, offices, schools, airports, hospitals, hotels and other public places. You also can put different type fluid soap in it: such as hand wash, shampoo,shower gel, dish wash, detergent and more. 【Easy To Install】When the walls in your home are smooth, you can choose punch-free stickers to protect your walls.When your wall is not smooth, you can use the installation kit. Convenient and fast, think what you think. 【Quality Assurance】We are a direct factory, and we will go through strict quality control before every product is produced. We provide a one-year quality guarantee. If you encounter any problems during use, please do not hesitate to contact us, we will give you a satisfactory answer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WSkQTHK1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SSKANG","source_asin":"B09D3BLS2V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1061574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D3BLS2V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D3BLS2V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
