window.products.push({"id":1061751,"name":"Chameleon Colors UV Color Powder - 12 Individual Packs with 6 Colors-UV Pigment Powder for School Events, Blacklight Dances, and Blacklight Photograph","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jlWusF4YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Let out your creative side! This kit is perfect for three to five people who are ready to throw some vibrant and glow-in-the-dark color powder. Designed for ease, these 70-gram bags are handfuls of fun! Carry them until just the right moment, tear the easy-open tab, pour into your hand, and let the color throwing begin. Each bag gives 2-3 handfuls. Plus, the vibrant color powders glow in blacklight! You get six brilliant colors of the rainbow: White, Yellow, Orange, Blue, Green, and Pink UV Colored Chalk Powder. This multipack is perfect for photoshoots, kid and teen parties, or just having some blacklight fun! The best part? The color powders are easy to clean. We recommend getting as much of the powders off before adding water. So shake, bounce, dance, wiggle, and blow off loose color from hair, skin, and clothes while it’s dry. Then, for the straggling color powder on your skin and hair, use a little shampoo and soap and you’re good to go. Or, if you need to freshen up your clothes, just toss them in a load of wash after you’ve done the color-chalk-powder-removal boogie, of course. When used on grass it will practically disappear, especially after one sprinkler cycle or a good rainstorm. These packets are super easy to carry, share, and throw. You can throw directly from an open bag, pour into your hands and throw, or pour them into our color bottles and squeeze. These are easy to carry around without spilling! Chameleon Color’s authentic color powder products have been enjoyed by millions all around the world. People love our color, and we’re confident that you will too. We take pride in our product using only the best and safest ingredients. We want to offer you the highest quality product possible. All of our ingredients are FD&C and D&C approved.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jlWusF4YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chameleon Colors","source_asin":"B01BPK9Z2C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1061751","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BPK9Z2C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BPK9Z2C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
