window.products.push({"id":1061764,"name":"Vicluke Massage Recliner Chair with Heated, 360 Degree Swivel Rocker Recliner Lounge Chair, Leather Reclining Sofa with Cup Holders for Living Room, L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G0EB2Y38L._AC_SL1438_.jpg","description":"360° SWIVEL & RECLINING: Swivel feature means you can easily move the recliner chair 360 degrees in either direction while sitting, which stops you from having to twist and turn in your chair or stand to reposition. Pull out the D-ring handle, you can adjust the recline angle between 120-150 degree to meet your different needs. The footrest can be smooth and easy to close which is more convenient for the elderly or pregnant. MASSAGE & HEATING: This massage recliner has 4 vibrating massage parts(8 points), 5 control modes, and 2 intensity options. You can enjoy a full body massage at your home. And it’s compatible with heat functions on the lumbar, it can well relieve your waist pressure and promote blood circulation while massaging. SUPERIOR QUALITY MATERIALS: Distinguished from other recliners, the high-density padding of our chairs are designed to be thicker and more ergonomic. Overstuffed cushions wrap your body for amazing comfort. Formaldehyde-free wood boards to absolutely protect the health of users. High-quality PU leather is breathable, durable and easy to clean. The metal frame of the swivel base is steady and durable. Weight capacity of 350LBS. USEFUL DETAILS DESIGN: 2 cup holders to hold drinks or phones to free your hands. And you can put small items within reach or magazines in the 2 side pockets when you are resting on it. If you accidentally spill a drink on the swivel recliner, just wipe it with a wet towel to remove the stain, away from the trouble of cleaning. We are committed to integrating multiple humanized designs to create more convenience for your life. EASY ASSEMBLY & SERVICE: This upholstered recliner comes with two boxes and all parts are included. It can be assembled easily according to the instruction. We offer a guaranteed 1-year warranty, you can feel free to contact us at any time, we will provide professional customer service within 24 hour.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G0EB2Y38L._AC_SL1438_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vicluke","source_asin":"B09F3JP3CL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1061764","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F3JP3CL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F3JP3CL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
