window.products.push({"id":1061851,"name":"Whole House Worlds The Rustic Bench, Reclaimed Farmhouse A-Frame Country Style, Repurposed Naturally Aged Mahogany Wood, Made by Hand, Approx. 4Ft","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-5mjKv-wL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Full of country charm and soul, our Rustic A-Frame Farmhouse Bench is crafted of beautifully aged salvaged mahogany. Reclaimed and repurposed, this fine hard wood has been transformed and given a new life by our craftsmen as a hardworking and durable bench. Made with meticulous care using a wooden pegs and cross beam support, this sturdy piece is inspired by elemental farm house benches that have been used for centuries. With an updated and chic modern design, this piece pairs with equal ease in a variety of design themes ranging from rustic to urban spaces. Just shy of 4 Ft, this bench sturdy and hardworking piece exactly measures as follows: 45 ¼L x 15W x 19 5/8H inches. The seat top measures 10 ¾ inches wide and is 1 ¾ inches thick. Each substantial leg is 3 1/8 x 2 inches. Gather friends at a moment’s notice and have fun. It’s easy to make sure everyone has a seat at the table when guests arrive impromptu. Pull this bench into any room of the house as a handy standby for additional seating. Just as easily, use it at the end of the bed to catch spare blankets, by the door to change and tuck away shoes, plus dozens of other uses. Great for Gifting, this piece is an amazing and thoughtful present. An ideal for many special occasions including housewarmings, weddings, birthdays, and many more, this Rustic Farmhouse Country Style Bench is a keepsake that is made to withstand decades of use and be passed on for generations. Welcome to the product line of Whole House Worlds. The New York based company offers high quality, stylish products for every room in the house, and beyond. From the kitchen, to the living room, to the bedroom, dining room, home office, closet and garden: Our criteria are comfort, quality, style and value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-5mjKv-wL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Whole House Worlds","source_asin":"B01MQMLUIH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1061851","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MQMLUIH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MQMLUIH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
