window.products.push({"id":1061981,"name":"Mama Bear And Papa Bear - 11oz Ceramic Coffee Mug Couples Sets Couple For Him And Her Daddy Mommy Great For Husband And Wife Children Holiday For Mom ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nC6pqnd3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This 2-mug Mama Bear, Papa Bear set makes a great gift for the special couple in your life, or keep one and give one to your significant other. These sturdy ceramic stoneware mugs will last many mornings of coffee or tea with the one you care about. Enjoy your favorite hot drink, whiskey, wine, or any other beverage of your choice with the person whose personality and mug match yours. These matching coffee mugs for couples make a great present for your favorite couple, whether you need a gift for an anniversary, engagement, wedding, or friend gift, or when you want to show your appreciation and gratitude to a special couple. Enjoy your morning coffee, tea, or juice in one of our 11-ounce ceramic mugs, great for cold drinks and hot drinks alike, while declaring your love for someone special. Start a great day with our lovers’ mug, perfect for everyday use. Our stoneware mugs with the design on both sides make a great gift or souvenir for any occasion, from birthdays to engagements, housewarmings, long-distance relationships, or simply missing that special person. Any time you want to show your appreciation with a cute and thoughtful gift anyone can use, the Mama Bear, Papa Bear design mug has your back. Each of our high-quality, scratch-resistant, dishwasher- and microwave-safe mugs is printed using the “sublimation method.” This technique leaves a permanent, non-fading design on both sides of your mug. We carefully package and ship each box of mugs to help the product arrive safely at your door. Your mug features: A sturdy mug for hot or cold drinks with an easy-grip, large handle A sturdy mug for hot or cold drinks with an easy-grip, large handle Cadmium free / lead free Cadmium free / lead free Design printed on both sides Design printed on both sides Dishwasher- and microwave-safe Dishwasher- and microwave-safe Images won’t crack, fade, peel, or scratch Images won’t crack, fade, peel, or scratch","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nC6pqnd3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crazy Bros Tees","source_asin":"B06XKL3WZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1061981","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XKL3WZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XKL3WZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1061982,"name":"Old Modern Handicrafts Lady Washington Collectible","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":314.74,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bAuWAfz6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The original lady Washington was a 90 ton merchant sloop that participated in the fur and pelt trade with the coastal native Americans in the pacific northwest as well as tea and porcelain across the pacific in china. She was the first American vessel to sail around cape horn as well as the first American vessel to reach japan. Master craftsmen using historical photographs, drawings or original plans meticulously handcraft these highly detailed wood models from scratch. They are built to scale with high-grade wood such as: western red cedar, rosewood, and mahogany. They are 100% hand built individually using plank-on-frame construction method and are similar to the building of actual ships. Each model requires hundreds of hours to finish and must go through a demanding quality control process before leaving the workshop. This beautiful lady Washington model features plank on frame and two decks. The front bowsprit and two large masts are connected securely using advanced rigging and lines painstakingly knotted and fastened by hand. Each yard has an attached hand-stitched unfurled sails made of fine linen. Metal anchors and a wooden rudder with metal propeller are visible on the front and rear of the ship. On the deck, there are authentic hand-built lifeboat with ribs and planks, wooden cabin, wooden crane and many other spectacular ornaments. This model comes standard with a solid wood base and brass nameplate. It'Ll make a perfect gift for home or office decorator, boat enthusiast or passionate collector.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bAuWAfz6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Old Modern Handicrafts","source_asin":"B0031HK9EG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1061982","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0031HK9EG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0031HK9EG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
